# OpenOCD through the swd_probe lane: line reset, JTAG to SWD, line reset, DPIDR; ABORT,
# SELECT 0 and the power-up handshake on CTRL/STAT (the SW-DP copies each request bit to
# its acknowledge); then the script reads CTRL/STAT, writes SELECT and reads it back through
# RDBUFF; OpenOCD leaves with a line reset and SWD to JTAG.
LINE_RESET
JTAG_TO_SWD
LINE_RESET
DP R 0x0 OK 2BA01477
DP W 0x0 OK 0000001E
DP W 0x8 OK 00000000
DP W 0x4 OK 50000020
DP R 0x4 OK F0000020
DP W 0x4 OK 50000000
DP R 0x4 OK F0000000
DP R 0x4 OK F0000000
DP R 0x4 OK F0000000
DP W 0x4 OK 50000001
DP R 0x4 OK F0000001
DP R 0x4 OK F0000001
DP W 0x8 OK 12345670
DP R 0xC OK 12345670
LINE_RESET
SWD_TO_JTAG
